msgstr "You are responsible for ensuring your equipment is safe and compliant with local regulations."

#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "You can define the permissions available to administrators and members, such as creating news posts, creating activities, and sharing discounts. You can appoint as many administrators as you wish."
msgstr "Puoi personalizzare i permessi concessi a soci e amministratori (postare notizie, indire uscite, condividere sconti) e nominare tutti i co-amministratori che desideri."

